    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n23913" root="صدأ" body-key="S">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">صَدَأٌ</span></b>  inf. n. of <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">صَدِئَ</span> [q. v.]. (S, M.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  Also [a
subst.] signifying The <i>rust</i> of iron, (S, M, * TA,)
and of copper and the like. (Har p. 481. [But
there erroneously written <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">صدآء</span>.]) ＝   
    <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer1"> </span>-A2-  Also A man
<i>slender in body;</i> (K, TA;) <i>light,</i> or <i>active,
therein:</i> its <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ء</span> is said to be substituted for <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ع</span>.
(TA. [See <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">صَدَعٌ</span>; and see also <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">صَدًى</span>.])

